{"id":336,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Seviper’s swordlike tail serves two purposes—it slashes foes and douses them with secreted poison. This Pokémon will not give up its long-running blood feud with Zangoose."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Seviper shares a generations-long feud with Zangoose. The scars on its body are evidence of vicious battles. This Pokémon attacks using its sword-edged tail."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It’s Zangoose’s archrival."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"In battle, it uses its bladed tail to counter any Zangoose. It secretes a deadly venom in its tail."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"For many generations, it has feuded with Zangoose. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"SEVIPER and ZANGOOSE are eternal rivals. It counters a ZANGOOSE’s dazzling agility with its swordlike tail, which also oozes a horrible poison."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shed Skin","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may cure its own status conditions by shedding its skin."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fluctuating","habitat":"grassland","color":"Black","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":336,"name":"Seviper","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,35],[1,207],[4,44],[6,122],[9,342],[11,364],[14,103],[19,137],[21,305],[24,474],[29,380],[31,398],[34,114],[39,242],[41,562],[44,489],[46,188]],"machine":[491,34,784,280,523,242,174,399,91,38,89,283,203,26